{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["<b>You shall not slaughter, etc.</b> You shall not slaughter the Pesach while chametz still exists — a warning to the one who slaughters, or to the one who sprinkles, or to any one of the members of the group (Pesachim 63)." "<b>And it shall not remain.</b> As its Targum renders; overnight remaining does not apply at the top of the altar, and overnight remaining applies only at the column of dawn (Zevachim 7)." "<b>The sacrifice of the festival of Pesach.</b> Its emurim — and from here you learn for all burning of fats and limbs."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:34.543862809Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}